<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow Electronics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow Electronics cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Wednesday it had cut its rating for Arrow Electronics Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the electronic parts and computer products distributor closed Tuesday at 57-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
